  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NGOWG WPS Advancing the WPS Agenda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall, the goal (impact) is sustainable peace, made possible through more inclusive conflict prevention, conflict resolution and reconstruction measures.

NGO Working Group has three goals for its work (outcome level):
&#x2022;	Women&#x2019;s participation and civil society engagement in peace and security processes has increased;
&#x2022;	The functioning of the UN Security Council has been enhanced and strengthened; and
&#x2022;	UN Leadership and Member States are held accontable for their WPS commitments.

Output level objectives:
1. Women leaders and civil society coalitions are engaged regularly in country-specific and thematic policymaking processes at both UN Headquarters and in field missions, in order to promote women and girls&#x2019; participation in peacebuilding and other peace and security processes; and
2. UN Security Council, senior UN Leadership and UN stakeholders are accountable for the implementation of all WPS resolutions, including Resolutions 2122 (2013) and 2242 (2015).</narrative>
  </description>
